    "Name: Colt Romero
Gender: Male
Race: Novakid

Colt was among the earliest Relic Seekers under Sofia Eclipse and remains the group's long-standing member to this day. Originally hired as a xenolingustics specialist, he is adept at ancient text translation, always finding peculiar details between the lines. His expertise proves to be invaluable in K'Rakothan history studies.",

"Aside from language and historical records, Colt is strongly invested in the cultural aspects of the ancient K'Rakothan society, particularly beliefs and religion. His contributions to research on these topics have made him the group's de-facto theologian.

He does however tend to work on his own, especially if he finds a topic more engaging than the rest. This sometimes makes it more difficult to study with him despite his courtesy."

